"The intake complex houses newly arrived Avowed teens at the water's edge on F City's far south side."
"Apartment towers ring its perimeter, and a gate with a security guard opens onto the street."
"Rabbits share a tower with Shapers and Healers below and Meisters and Adjusters above."
"The next tower is almost all Brutes, with Unique-class Avowed on their own top floor."
"The Brute tower lobby holds ten-foot bronze statues of Brute types on raised platforms."
"Wrights live in a square, blocky apartment building nearby."
"Sways live in a low, prison-like brick building that is nice inside, and mingle little."
"The Rabbit floors are affectionately called the Warren, full of friendly, social Rabbits."
"Each suite has four bedrooms, a kitchen and a talking point like a pinball machine."
"Suites have wall TVs, Wright-made magic coffee makers and windows over the Pacific."
"Doors bolt automatically and open by interface command, with no keys."
"The cafeteria on the second floor serves a dozen languages' food; vending machines are free."
"Community spaces by the elevators have beanbags, air hockey and floor-to-ceiling windows."
"A calendar schedules activities from 6 AM to a loosely enforced midnight curfew."
"Residents must earn credits from activities, and overstaying intake gets them evicted."
"Counselors of their own class live on site; the Rabbits have Neha by day and Gus by night."
"Newcomers may not teleport in guests from home for their first few months on the island."
"Every new resident is first screened by video with a therapist who treats Avowed trauma."
"Alden lived on the ninth floor of the Warren, across from Natalie Choir in room 914."
"Wall panels set 'Do Not Disturb' on other residents' interfaces; apartments are soundproofed."
"The counselors' shared office is an apartment on the eighth floor with its beds swapped for desks."
"The Warren's lobby hosts send-offs for residents heading to hero-track tests."
"Intake runs orientation classes, including Artonan etiquette and sex-ed, and a Spree day."
"The intake complex is far from Apex, and its newcomers are well guarded."
"At Halloween residents trick-or-treat by buzzer panel and compete for the spookiest door."
"Newcomers get an enormous stack of coupons, such as fifteen percent off parasailing."
